{"t": 1794781554441, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "event1_resolved", "Tick 8359: Lost traveller event, chose 'Share a meal for the map (1 food)'. Feedback is clear: apples 40->39, toast + chronicle say a map marks stone and a cache ~160 paces south-east. But no marker/waypoint appears on screen or compass, so the 'map' is just text; also Objective 5 'Enter your settlement' still shows incomplete though I entered it with E at tick 5515."]}
